WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
No problem, boss

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,320
When you go to work during the Chinese New Year, you can sleep in the Yuyu room.

3
00:00:03,320 --> 00:00:04,320
It also saves you running back and forth.

4
00:00:05,320 --> 00:00:06,320
Let’s rent another house after the New Year.

5
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:08,320
It's not safe for you, a girl, to rent there

6
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:10,320
I will give you a salary increase when you come back during the New Year

7
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,320
Don't save this little money

8
00:00:12,640 --> 00:00:13,640
I know, boss

9
00:00:13,640 --> 00:00:19,220
How many days are left until wages are paid?

10
00:00:19,220 --> 00:00:25,550
I'll send it to you first, boss.

11
00:00:25,550 --> 00:00:26,550
Did you send it wrong?

12
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:31,220
Correct

13
00:00:31,220 --> 00:00:32,220
This is what you deserve

14
00:00:32,220 --> 00:00:34,220
This money is partly salary

15
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:37,820
The rest is your New Year red envelope, but

16
00:00:37,820 --> 00:00:38,860
This is too much given, right?

17
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:41,860
Do you make so many glasses of juice every day?
